 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Isekai Ouji, Oshikake Kyuukon ni Mairima Shita"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "異世界皇子、おしかけ求婚に参りました"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Ran was summoned as a god child in another world and saved the world. Despite the efforts of Prince Rubel to stop her, she returned to this world and tried her best to lead a normal life. One day, as she is gradually getting used to the workplace she was lucky enough to find, she hears the familiar sound of hoofbeats... and when she turns around, there is His Imperial Highness the Prince. \"God says we should be together this time...!” \nThe Prince has decided to join Ran's team as a new employee! Ran is confused, but as if to push him away, the Prince asks for her hand in marriage, saying, “I will make you happy!\"\n\n This is a comedy of love between the prince, who is naive and out of sync in both his professional and private life, and Lan, who is looking for an ordinary life!\n\n(CMOA.JP, translated)"
  },
